1743536060000	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-2379649998032900593"},"published":{"$t":"2025-04-01T15:34:20.000-04:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-25T22:58:20.798-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali literature"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali Poetry"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Poetry"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Ramblings"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"हो, म बहुला हुँ।"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"उनीहरु- शीवलाई सर्वशक्तिमान मात्र देख्ने, विष्णुलाई पालक मात्र देख्ने, रामलाई न्यायी मात्र देख्ने, कृष्णलाई आदर्श-पूरुष बनाउने। मैले- शिवलाई भाङ्ग-धतुरो खाने पनि देखेँ, मैले व्रिन्दालाई गरेको छल पनि देखेँ, मैले सीतामाथी… उनीहरू भन्छन- खै कुन ढुङ्गामा र खै कुन मूर्तीमा, ईश्वर भेटिन्छ अरे, हामी हिन्दू, ऊ ख्रिस्टियन, र त्यो मुसलमान अरे। फेरि थप्छन- हामी ब्राह्मण, ऊ अछुत, र तिनीहरू म्लेच्छ अरे। म भनेँ"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/2379649998032900593/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2025/04/ho-ma-bahula-hun.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/2379649998032900593"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/2379649998032900593"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2025/04/ho-ma-bahula-hun.html","title":"हो, म बहुला हुँ।"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/","url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1grDXVcPTmZ_W8MyxovSYlV_zEZk2UifN=s72-w1200-c","height":"72","width":"72"},"thr$total":{"$t":"0"}}
1743454801000	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-6667487798373486540"},"published":{"$t":"2025-03-31T17:00:01.000-04:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-25T22:57:55.221-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali Poetry"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Poetry"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Ramblings"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"ऊ-ध्रुव, म-परिक्रमा"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"लाग्छ, धेरै ताराहरू मिलेर बनेकी छे ऊ; रातको अँध्यारोमा चम्कन्छे उही, लाग्छ, ऊ घाम हो; जसको वरिपरी घुमिरहेको छु, जसको उज्यालोमा, मस्त झुलेका- मेरा नयनहरू, हरेक ति कुण्ठाहरू, शरीरभरी चलेका आँधीपुराणहरू। रमिरहेको छु, ती… अनगन्ति ताराहरू माझ, चम्किरहेकी धुर्वतारा ऊ: हरेक रात, उसैको मनको निर्देशनमा नजरका पखेटा हालेर भौतरी रहन्छन् मेरा आँखाहरू। हरेक दिन, उसैको प्रतिक्षामा पलेटी कसेका मेरा कुण्ठाहरू, उसक"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/6667487798373486540/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2025/03/u-dhruva-ma-parikrama.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/6667487798373486540"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/6667487798373486540"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2025/03/u-dhruva-ma-parikrama.html","title":"ऊ-ध्रुव, म-परिक्रमा"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/","url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1B1CsiJj0uOgXM_hVu_rS68G2Zj4QdA77=s72-w1200-c","height":"72","width":"72"},"thr$total":{"$t":"0"}}
1743294078000	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-2033686653633212643"},"published":{"$t":"2025-03-29T20:21:18.000-04:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-21T06:33:54.108-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Musings"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali literature"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali Poetry"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Poetry"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"सपनाका यथार्थहरू।"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"देखिरहन्छु- सपनाहरू विपनामै, परीपरीका, थरीथरीका, रङ्गविरङ्गका, तर अनुभव गर्न सक्दिनँ, अँगाल्न पाउँदिनँ, अनि यथार्थले किच्छ। त्यसपछि सोच्छु- कस्का लागि हुन् यी सपनाहरू? केका लागि हुन् यी सपनाहरू? भक्कानिएर आउँछ, दुख्छ… हरेक दिन- पुर्वी आकाशमा: उदाउँछ सुर्य, दिनभरि ज्योति बनेर हाँस्छ, हरेक रात- पश्चिम आकाशमा: चन्द्रमा, त्यसैगरी, चमकन्छ। यी दुई- कहिल्यै भेटेनन्, कहिल्यै भेट्नेछैनन फेरि, न कहिल्यै आँख"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/2033686653633212643/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2025/03/realityofdreams.html#comment-form","title":"1 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/2033686653633212643"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/2033686653633212643"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2025/03/realityofdreams.html","title":"सपनाका यथार्थहरू।"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"media$