1741123986000	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-2552982653492458046"},"published":{"$t":"2025-03-04T16:33:06.000-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-21T06:21:26.904-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Musings"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali literature"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali Poetry"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Poetry"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"धुवाँमा चलेको सहर"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"धुवाँमा अनुहार हराए, सडकमा पाइला हराए, सहरमा सबैले- ठेगाना सोध्दै हिँड्छन्, तर यहाँ कसैलाई- बाटो थाहा हुँदैन। सहरको छातीमा उठिरहेको धुवाँ, फगत बाफ न हो, ठहरिएको सहर तताउन मानिसहरूले फालेको- सडकले थाम्न नसकेको। रोकिएको त यात्रु बस हैन, रोकिएका त अनुहारहरू छन्, बिहान-बेलुकीको- हतार-लतारा-चतारामा, सडकमै हराएका सपनाहरू, सहरले थिचेका आकांक्षाहरू। सहरले थोपरिदिएको अदृश्य थकान बोकेर, समयको ऋण तिर्दै, मूल"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/2552982653492458046/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2025/03/dhuwanma-chaleko-sahar.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/2552982653492458046"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/2552982653492458046"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2025/03/dhuwanma-chaleko-sahar.html","title":"धुवाँमा चलेको सहर"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.g